.SH NAME
frontend/node_modules/camelcase-css Directory Reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "camelcase-css [![NPM Version][npm-image]][npm-url] [![Build Status][travis-image]][travis-url]"
.PP
.RS 4
Convert a kebab-cased CSS property into a camelCased DOM property\&. 
.RE
.PP
.SH "Installation"
.PP
\fRNode\&.js\fP \fR>= 6\fP is required\&. Type this at the command line: 
.PP
.nf
npm install camelcase\-css

.fi
.PP
.SH "Usage"
.PP
.PP
.nf
const camelCaseCSS = require('camelcase\-css');

camelCaseCSS('\-webkit\-border\-radius');  //\-> WebkitBorderRadius
camelCaseCSS('\-moz\-border\-radius');     //\-> MozBorderRadius
camelCaseCSS('\-ms\-border\-radius');      //\-> msBorderRadius
camelCaseCSS('border\-radius');          //\-> borderRadius
.fi
.PP
 
